    {
      "no": 2,
      "type": "解答题",
      "score": 10,
      "stem": "解线性方程组：x + y + z = 6，2x - y + z = 3，x + 2y - z = 2。",
      "options": [],
      "student_answer": "所以 z = 6 - 1 + 2 = 7。",
      "student_steps": [
        "解：由第一个方程得 z = 6 - x - y，",
        "代入后两个方程得 x - 2y = -3，2x + 3y = 8，",
        "解得 y = 2，x = 1，",
        "所以 z = 6 - 1 + 2 = 7。"
      ],
      "status": "wrong",
